WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.108 --> 00:00:09.036
What is Microsoft Soundscape? Microsoft Soundscape is an app that is being

00:00:09.036 --> 00:00:13.829
developed in partnership with Guide Dogs UK and is currently available for iOS.

00:00:13.829 --> 00:00:17.380
Microsoft Soundscape provides information about your surroundings, helping

00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:21.092
you to build a rich mental map of the cities and places you visit.

00:00:21.092 --> 00:00:25.103
And it does this by using 3D audio. By simply connecting

00:00:25.103 --> 00:00:28.206
any stereo headset, whether that be bluetooth or wired,

00:00:28.206 --> 00:00:30.920
you'll experience rich 3D audio as you navigate the outdoor

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:35.250
world. Microsoft Soundscape is all about giving you choice.

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:38.044
Rather than dictate what you should do, the app allows you to

00:00:38.044 --> 00:00:41.795
make your own decisions based on information being provided,

00:00:41.795 --> 00:00:46.355
putting you in control. You can use Microsoft Soundscape in a number

00:00:46.355 --> 00:00:50.096
of different ways, whether that be using it on a well-known route,

00:00:50.096 --> 00:00:53.249
using it with a friend, or, if you're feeling more adventurous,

00:00:53.249 --> 00:00:57.998
using it to discover new places you've never visited before.

00:00:57.998 --> 00:01:00.941
During development, our trials and research show that Microsoft

00:01:00.941 --> 00:01:04.414
Soundscape can help reduce levels of stress and anxiety,

00:01:04.420 --> 00:01:09.360
giving people with sight loss more confidence when they're out and about in an urban environment.

00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:13.940
Microsoft Soundscape, lighting up your world through sound.

